776
01:53:54.522 --> 01:53:59.522
These are the four philosophical forms of love.

777
01:53:59.522 --> 01:54:05.522
We all know eros. Eroticism is that you love something physically.

778
01:54:05.522 --> 01:54:07.522
So you are attracted to a person.

779
01:54:07.522 --> 01:54:15.522
