782
01:54:21.522 --> 01:54:25.522
If you both enjoy a sport, you go play soccer together.

783
01:54:25.522 --> 01:54:28.522
If it is soccer.

784
01:54:28.522 --> 01:54:32.522
And when you both enjoy something, then you have a phileo for the same thing.

785
01:54:32.522 --> 01:54:34.522
The same love for something.

786
01:54:34.522 --> 01:54:36.522
That is the same attraction.

787
01:54:36.522 --> 01:54:40.522
