795
01:55:03.522 --> 01:55:08.522
Because you love your children and you love your wife and you love your community.

796
01:55:08.522 --> 01:55:10.522
And then you have storge love.

797
01:55:10.522 --> 01:55:12.522
And then you have agape love.

798
01:55:12.522 --> 01:55:16.522
Agape love is the love that God has for people.

799
01:55:16.522 --> 01:55:18.522
He was perfect.

800
01:55:18.522 --> 01:55:20.522
He did nothing.

801
01:55:20.522 --> 01:55:26.522
But despite the fact that he has done nothing, he sacrificed himself for my life.

802
01:55:26.522 --> 01:55:29.522
And he gave himself.

803
01:55:29.522 --> 01:55:32.522
So that I can be free in the name of Jesus.

804
01:55:32.522 --> 01:55:38.522
Agape love means that you sacrifice yourself for someone else.

805
01:55:38.522 --> 01:55:40.522
And here is the wordplay.

806
01:55:40.522 --> 01:55:43.522
Twice Jesus asks Simon Peter.

807
01:55:43.522 --> 01:55:46.522
Simon Peter, do you agape me?

808
01:55:46.522 --> 01:55:55.522
And to agape me means, Simon Peter, would you be willing to sacrifice yourself for other people in my name?

809
01:55:55.522 --> 01:55:58.522
And do you know how Simon Peter responds?

810
01:55:58.522 --> 01:56:01.522
Jesus, I fileo you.

811
01:56:01.522 --> 01:56:08.522
In other words, Jesus is making an invitation to enter into agape love for the humanity around him.

812
01:56:08.522 --> 01:56:10.522
And Peter is on the level of fileo.

813
01:56:10.522 --> 01:56:13.522
Jesus, I love you. You are my friend.

814
01:56:13.522 --> 01:56:15.522
And Jesus does it one more time.

815
01:56:15.522 --> 01:56:18.522
Peter, do you agape me?

816
01:56:18.522 --> 01:56:20.522
And Peter says it again.

817
01:56:20.522 --> 01:56:23.522
Jesus, I fileo you.

818
01:56:23.522 --> 01:56:26.522
You are my friend. You know that I am your friend, right?

819
01:56:26.522 --> 01:56:30.522
That is why the basic Bible says, you know that I am your friend, right?

820
01:56:30.522 --> 01:56:37.522
And a third time Jesus says, and now Jesus says, Peter, do you fileo me?

821
01:56:37.522 --> 01:56:44.522
In other words, love brings Jesus down to the level of who Peter is.

822
01:56:44.522 --> 01:56:48.522
And then Jesus says to Peter, are you really my friend?

823
01:56:48.522 --> 01:56:50.522
And that broke him.

824
01:56:50.522 --> 01:56:52.522
And that broke him.

825
01:56:52.522 --> 01:56:56.522
And then Peter replies, I am your friend again.

826
01:56:56.522 --> 01:56:58.522
I am your friend.

827
01:56:58.522 --> 01:57:01.522
The clue in this is this.

828
01:57:01.522 --> 01:57:11.522
Forgiveness is of utmost importance in your life if you believe in the resurrection of Jesus.

829
01:57:12.522 --> 01:57:14.522
Resurrection of Jesus.

830
01:57:14.522 --> 01:57:17.522
But you can, triangle what I am about to say.

831
01:57:17.522 --> 01:57:19.522
Resurrection of Jesus.

832
01:57:19.522 --> 01:57:21.522
But you cannot forgive yourself.

833
01:57:21.522 --> 01:57:26.522
The whole resurrection is void for you.

834
01:57:27.522 --> 01:57:29.522
Resurrection of Jesus.

835
01:57:29.522 --> 01:57:33.522
But you cannot forgive your brother or sister for what he or she has done.

836
01:57:33.522 --> 01:57:40.522
John says, if you do not love your brother, but you say that you love God, you do not love God.

837
01:57:40.522 --> 01:57:45.522
Forgiveness is essential.

838
01:57:45.522 --> 01:57:49.522
The cross has given forgiveness for your sin.

839
01:57:49.522 --> 01:57:58.522
But now we must, just like fish and just like feeding, we must keep coming back to the cross to learn to forgive.

840
01:57:58.522 --> 01:58:01.522
Will you forgive me, Lord, for what I have done?

841
01:58:01.522 --> 01:58:04.522
Will you forgive me, Lord, for what I do wrong?

842
01:58:04.522 --> 01:58:08.522
Help me, Lord, to forgive my brother or sister in the church?

843
01:58:08.522 --> 01:58:11.522
For I have been hurt.

844
01:58:11.522 --> 01:58:16.522
Help me, Lord, to go to my brother or sister to ask for forgiveness?

845
01:58:16.522 --> 01:58:19.522
Help me to go deeper?

846
01:58:19.522 --> 01:58:27.522
Help me, Lord, to have both agape love and storge love, as well as phileo love?

847
01:58:27.522 --> 01:58:30.522
Can we all close our eyes for a moment?

848
01:58:30.522 --> 01:58:35.522
Please, everyone close your eyes for a moment.

849
01:58:35.522 --> 01:58:40.522
Dear Holy Spirit, I want to ask you to help us as a church...

850
01:58:40.522 --> 01:58:46.522
...to work this concept of forgiveness in our hearts.

851
01:58:46.522 --> 01:58:52.522
Lord, I know this is a very complex prayer and goes very deep and complex.

852
01:58:52.522 --> 01:58:56.522
But you have gone deeper than anything else.

853
01:58:56.522 --> 01:59:01.522
And I want to pray over the whole Open Church in the name of Jesus.

854
01:59:01.522 --> 01:59:05.522
That we can work forgiveness in our hearts.

855
01:59:05.522 --> 01:59:08.522
Lord, I want to pray in the name of Jesus...

856
01:59:08.522 --> 01:59:12.522
...that you teach us what agape love is.

857
01:59:12.522 --> 01:59:16.522
Lord, I want to pray for all the people in this church.

858
01:59:16.522 --> 01:59:18.522
Whatever we have experienced.

859
01:59:18.522 --> 01:59:20.522
Whatever has been done to us.

860
01:59:20.522 --> 01:59:24.522
How much it hurts what people do to us.

861
01:59:24.522 --> 01:59:28.522
How much it hurts what we have done to ourselves.

862
01:59:28.522 --> 01:59:33.522
How difficult it is to go to someone and say sorry.

863
01:59:33.522 --> 01:59:35.522
Help us, Holy Spirit.

864
01:59:36.522 --> 01:59:40.522
Jesus, help us, for you are the King of forgiveness.

865
01:59:40.522 --> 01:59:46.522
Help us in our hearts to be able to work on forgiveness.

866
01:59:46.522 --> 01:59:48.522
So that we can forgive ourselves.

867
01:59:48.522 --> 01:59:51.522
When there is difficulty in forgiving yourself.

868
01:59:51.522 --> 01:59:53.522
I declare it over your life.

869
01:59:53.522 --> 01:59:56.522
That you will receive forgiveness in the name of Jesus.

870
01:59:56.522 --> 02:00:00.522
Help us, Lord, to forgive the people next to us.

871
02:00:00.522 --> 02:00:03.522
And to go to someone in forgiveness.

872
02:00:03.522 --> 02:00:06.522
Help us, Lord, in the mighty name of Jesus.

873
02:00:06.522 --> 02:00:09.522
And if you believe this and if you want to receive this for your life.

874
02:00:09.522 --> 02:00:11.522
Then say amen.

875
02:00:11.522 --> 02:00:14.522
And the last one I have, and then I will close the service.

876
02:00:14.522 --> 02:00:16.522
Is to follow.

877
02:00:16.522 --> 02:00:18.522
Jesus says in verse 19.

878
02:00:18.522 --> 02:00:24.522
He said this to let Peter know what kind of death he would later glorify God.

879
02:00:24.522 --> 02:00:27.522
If you are going to follow God.

880
02:00:27.522 --> 02:00:32.522
The resurrection of Jesus means that you have become a new creation.

881
02:00:32.522 --> 02:00:34.522
And you have become a new creation.

882
02:00:34.522 --> 02:00:37.522
Also means that you no longer live for yourself.

883
02:00:37.522 --> 02:00:40.522
But that you have become a new creation in Him.

884
02:00:40.522 --> 02:00:43.522
In other words, you are born again.

885
02:00:43.522 --> 02:00:47.522
And all at once Jesus says, now you no longer live for yourself.

886
02:00:47.522 --> 02:00:50.522
Now it is no longer what you think is good for your life.

887
02:00:50.522 --> 02:00:53.522
But now you will align yourself with the Word of God.

888
02:00:53.522 --> 02:00:57.522
And if then through the Spirit God gives you a task.

889
02:00:57.522 --> 02:01:01.522
You have become an ambassador for His kingdom.

890
02:01:01.522 --> 02:01:07.522
Following Jesus means that we can follow Him in everything.

891
02:01:08.522 --> 02:01:10.522
And where has Jesus gone?

892
02:01:10.522 --> 02:01:13.522
Jesus ultimately went to death.

893
02:01:13.522 --> 02:01:18.522
He rose from the dead, but He did indeed go through this death.

894
02:01:18.522 --> 02:01:26.522
And following Jesus means that we, as a church, must be willing to follow Him in everything.

895
02:01:26.522 --> 02:01:28.522
Leave everything behind.

896
02:01:28.522 --> 02:01:30.522
Give up everything.

897
02:01:30.522 --> 02:01:36.522
The people I see in the gospel who followed Jesus were willing to leave everything behind.

898
02:01:36.522 --> 02:01:42.522
Even Zacchaeus, a very corrupt man, chose to want to follow Jesus.

899
02:01:42.522 --> 02:01:46.522
And to give away everything that was once his old life.

900
02:01:46.522 --> 02:01:49.522
I give it all away because I want to follow Jesus.

901
02:01:49.522 --> 02:01:53.522
John left everything behind to follow Jesus.

902
02:01:53.522 --> 02:01:55.522
Thomas went to India.

903
02:01:55.522 --> 02:01:58.522
All kinds of people did all sorts of things for God.

904
02:01:58.522 --> 02:02:03.522
Those great and mighty things were to be fishers of men.

905
02:02:03.522 --> 02:02:10.522
But they were willing and realistically all went to their deaths because they chose to follow Jesus.

906
02:02:10.522 --> 02:02:17.522
My call is not to say that we all must die in a gruesome way if we want to follow Jesus.

907
02:02:17.522 --> 02:02:24.522
My call at this moment is, will we follow Jesus with everything He asks of us?

908
02:02:24.522 --> 02:02:27.522
Shall we stand?

909
02:02:27.522 --> 02:02:30.522
Hallelujah.

910
02:02:30.522 --> 02:02:35.522
I will close the service. The band does not need to come back on stage.

911
02:02:35.522 --> 02:02:39.522
Hallelujah. Can we close our eyes at the end of the service?

912
02:02:39.522 --> 02:02:42.522
To follow Jesus, that is what I want to pray for.

913
02:02:42.522 --> 02:02:45.522
To follow Jesus.

914
02:02:45.522 --> 02:02:48.522
Hallelujah. Hallelujah.

915
02:02:49.522 --> 02:02:53.522
Lord Jesus. Lord Jesus. Lord Jesus.

916
02:02:53.522 --> 02:02:55.522
Lord Jesus.

917
02:02:55.522 --> 02:03:10.522
If you end the Gospel of John with the words to make it clear to Peter what it would cost him to follow Jesus.

918
02:03:10.522 --> 02:03:17.522
Then I want to ask you, Lord, help us because apparently, it matters greatly to you.

919
02:03:17.522 --> 02:03:21.522
That we follow you in whatever it may be.

920
02:03:21.522 --> 02:03:28.522
Help us to follow you in everything that entails.

921
02:03:28.522 --> 02:03:31.522
Help us to follow you when it is difficult.

922
02:03:31.522 --> 02:03:35.522
Help us to follow you when we do not understand you.

923
02:03:35.522 --> 02:03:40.522
Help us to follow when your voice seems vague.

924
02:03:41.522 --> 02:03:48.522
Oh Lord, help us to understand your calling voice.

925
02:03:48.522 --> 02:03:53.522
You are the good shepherd and my sheep recognize my voice, says the Bible.

926
02:03:53.522 --> 02:03:56.522
And I want to pray for all the people in this room.

927
02:03:56.522 --> 02:04:01.522
That when it is difficult for you to still hear the voice of Jesus.

928
02:04:02.522 --> 02:04:04.522
Focus on this prayer.

929
02:04:04.522 --> 02:04:10.522
Holy Spirit, make the voice of Jesus clear in our lives.

930
02:04:10.522 --> 02:04:12.522
So that we can follow him.

931
02:04:12.522 --> 02:04:18.522
Holy Spirit, help us to understand Scripture when we read it.

932
02:04:18.522 --> 02:04:26.522
Holy Spirit, help us to follow you even if it is in our own spiritual grave.

933
02:04:26.522 --> 02:04:29.522
That we can die to ourselves.

934
02:04:29.522 --> 02:04:38.522
Jesus says a seed can only become a fruitful tree if it first dies to itself in the ground.

935
02:04:38.522 --> 02:04:43.522
Help us Lord to follow you even to the grave.

936
02:04:43.522 --> 02:04:48.522
Help us Lord to follow you in the tasks you have for us.

937
02:04:48.522 --> 02:04:51.522
I believe with all that is within me.

938
02:04:51.522 --> 02:04:56.522
That there are people in this room who have a calling on their lives.

939
02:04:57.522 --> 02:05:01.522
Of whom they cannot yet recognize Christ at this moment.

940
02:05:01.522 --> 02:05:09.522
In other words, there are ministries and callings of the Lord here that have not yet borne fruit.

941
02:05:09.522 --> 02:05:12.522
And I pray in the name of Jesus.

942
02:05:12.522 --> 02:05:16.522
That we will learn to follow Jesus in His way.

943
02:05:16.522 --> 02:05:18.522
In His way.

944
02:05:18.522 --> 02:05:25.522
So that we can come to the ministry He has for us through His way.

945
02:05:26.522 --> 02:05:33.522
Oh Lord, make me and make open church followers of You, Lord Jesus.

946
02:05:33.522 --> 02:05:37.522
And I pray this in the mighty name of the risen Lord.

947
02:05:37.522 --> 02:05:40.522
And we all say amen.

948
02:05:46.522 --> 02:05:48.522
We are going to stop.

949
02:05:48.522 --> 02:05:51.522
Father in heaven, I thank You for this wonderful church.

950
02:05:51.522 --> 02:05:53.522
I thank You for this wonderful service.

951
02:05:53.522 --> 02:05:57.522
And I bless us in the name of Jesus as we go home.

952
02:05:57.522 --> 02:06:00.522
And that we will know that we have a risen Lord.

953
02:06:00.522 --> 02:06:02.522
In His name is Jesus. Amen.

954
02:06:02.522 --> 02:06:04.522
Amen. Bye bye.
